      "value": "@{58c62e995865713647a7115b|full_name}: I've successfully reproduced the bug 4 times. Using Vive in full body tracking.\n\nStarting my SteamVR, playspacemover, OVRDrop and Battery info panel.\n\nLoading into my starting world I load into the full body IK and minimize VRChat(since I always have it minimized). I then load into another world while clicking around on my OVRDrop (Opening your SteamVR menu and clicking around using the Desktop feature also works) while loading into the world it starts bugging out by loading taking extra time and almost attempting to re-load multiple times, after some time it loads into the world and my model + menu is non-existent, I don't show up in mirrors etc either, I can however interact with panels.\n\nLog\n(The bug happened while loading from treehouse to hangout house):\nhttps://pastebin.com/n0GxNV0W\n\nScreenshots: showing me interacting with a panel, looking in the mirror with my model gone, and me enabling safety mode to make my model reload that makes it show up.",
      "viewerReactions": null
